msgid "the turn was stopped because the session search index (FTS5) is corrupt and could not be detached, so this message was not saved. The message store itself is not damaged: do not run recovery tools or restore a backup. Run `hermes {profile_arg}doctor --fix` (or restart Hermes, which repairs the index on open), then send your message again."
