msgid ""
"{toggle}\n"
"\n"
"**How /voice works**\n"
"• `/voice on` — voice reply when you send a voice message\n"
"• `/voice tts` — voice reply to *every* message\n"
"• `/voice off` — back to text-only replies\n"
"• `/voice status` — show the current mode\n"
