msgctxt "[\"Hermes Agent\",\"platform.google_chat\",\"Hermes Agent locale key platform.google_chat.setup_files.not_configured\",\"platform.google_chat.setup_files.not_configured\",\"162b6d7f2be3c27daefcd50a\"]"
msgid ""
"🔧 Native attachment delivery is **not configured**.\n"
"**Step 1 (one-time, on the host):** create OAuth client credentials at https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials → *Create credentials* → *OAuth client ID* → *Desktop app*. Download the JSON. Then on the host run:\n"
"```\n"
"python -m plugins.platforms.google_chat.oauth --client-secret /path/to/client_secret.json\n"
"```\n"
"**Step 2:** come back here and send `/setup-files start`."
msgstr ""
"🔧 Inbyggd leverans av bilagor är **inte konfigurerad**.\n"
"**Steg 1 (en gång, på värden):** skapa OAuth-klientuppgifter på https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials → *Create credentials* → *OAuth client ID* → *Desktop app*. Hämta JSON-filen. Kör sedan på värden:\n"
"```\n"
"python -m plugins.platforms.google_chat.oauth --client-secret /path/to/client_secret.json\n"
"```\n"
"**Steg 2:** kom tillbaka hit och skicka `/setup-files start`."

